n Kimball was a star around here. I wanted the same kind, and I could play it pretty good. Get to New York with a banjo. I'm around there for about two weeks. While I'm there they take me to the Rhythm Club, Paul Barbarin and Red Allen. Rhythm Club was where . . . They had about three clubs around there: the Mimo Club ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13969$652930F8-8988-4E4C-8AE9-99406B73C65F", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "19f24e8851eb1e66d27437eba7f3e7a669808888", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/eb031d08a1a7e4523782556da91b06a1/403.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13969$15AD4472-CEAF-4A58-B507-3BC6FAFE2C17", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "d7f971e40f3960b7fff347fcf46f83b6d13b277a", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1508, "id": "Q1508"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13969$517B6D84-93AD-4159-A14B-8A7F41272790", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "221da7018b2f7920618dd26bb7f874297a94a205", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 24, "id": "Q24"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13969$63EE8CA5-7BB8-47E4-95ED-EEF43E99EAE5", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "de35f98eba9663d86fd8d5175d5b5ce669ac74b1", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1505, "id": "Q1505"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13969$AC35E136-44C1-4EB7-BBB8-BAE27E5EB95E", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "80a818e6c7afe99327e1e024af57f01bef25b009", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "nu